OL,3,GNEWSAReleased killer tells police 'it's
OL,4,Ahappened again'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convicted killer has admitted
OL,7,Fmurdering a man on New Year's Eve,
OL,8,Ftelling police "it's happened again."
OL,10,FDaniel Levy, 48, stabbed 41-year-old
OL,11,FAbdul Kaleem Shaik in the neck at his
OL,12,Fhome in Vauxhall before going to
OL,13,FBishopsgate Police Station on 1
OL,14,FJanuary, the Old Bailey heard.
OL,16,FOfficers found Shaik's body on a
OL,17,Fmakeshift bed in the flat, and Levy was
OL,18,Farrested and charged with murder.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
