OL,3,GNEWSAReleased killer tells police 'it's
OL,4,Ahappened again'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLevy, who has schizophrenia, had
OL,7,Fpreviously been convicted of the
OL,8,Fmanslaughter - by reason of diminished
OL,9,Fresponsibility - of his grandmother,
OL,10,Fafter stabbing her and setting her on
OL,11,Ffire in 2000.
